TITLE:: StammerView
summary:: Stammer's display
categories:: Libraries>Stammer
related:: Classes/Stammer, Classes/FxParamView, Classes/FxParamPanel

DESCRIPTION::
What link::Classes/FxParamPanel:: puts at the top of Stammer's window. In it, drag for where in the interval it goes; the wheel for how long it holds; the bars are the slices, falling and fading as the settings say, and light up while it is really going.

It draws from the object's settings and the replies its meters bring, so it is only live while the window is running; link::Classes/FxParamView:: has the rest.

